# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ⚠️  NOTE ON firebase_options.dart
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# firebase_options.dart contains Firebase *app config* (API keys),
# NOT secrets in Firebase's terminology. These keys are already
# embedded in any built APK and are designed to be public — they
# only grant access as allowed by your Firestore security rules.
# It is safe (and standard) to commit this file for student projects.
# Uncomment the line below ONLY if you want to force every contributor
# to run `flutterfire configure` themselves:
# lib/firebase_options.dart
